NPCs: {
	Villain: {
		DisplayName: Villain
		Census.SpawnCondtions: Defeat three unique bosses
		QuestButton: Hero's Quest

		Quests: {
			Gravedigger: Gravedigger
			BloodMoonFishing: Blood Moon Fishing
			Clickbait: Clickbait
			ShadowWizard: Shadow Wizard
			TheMightyKraken: The Mighty Kraken
		}

		Chat: {
			Normal1: What's that? You wanna be a hero? You've come to the right man!
			Normal2: Hello everybody it's me, Mark (E) the Villain.
			Normal3: Did you know I scale to High-Transcendental! You see, chainscaling off of Yharim's YharHar Buster, which we all know is universe+, we can place the Sword of Infinity in a first order cardinality set that...
			Normal4: If you could, I would like a nice tea set for my next birthday.
			Normal5: You may falter in your journey as much as you like, young warrior, just remember to get back up again.
			Homeless1: I'd build myself a house, but I think you should do it yourself. Hah! I'm so villainous.
			Homeless2: The Sun doesn't like me all that much, I need a shelter against it.
			MoonLordHint: You know... that shining lamp in the dark sky has a monster chained to it. Shall I free it so you can prove your strength?
			BloodMoon1: "{0}! Come on in! I know things look a little bad right now. Would you like some chocolate?"
			BloodMoon2: Dude, if you don't leave like, right now, I'm seriously going to knock your teeth out.
			Graveyard1: I like to spend some time memorizing the names on these tombstones. Only for a bit, though. I'm scared of ghosts.
			Graveyard2: These grave markers all have your name on it. Why?
			Space1: Every now and then the Sun likes to concentrate its rays into a singular beam aimed at my forehead.
			Space2: One time I tried building a space station but I kept getting meteors thrown at me. I still don't know who did it.
			Thunderstorm1: I heard that if you get hit by lightning, you can gain special powers. Have I tried it myself? Uh... yeah! That's why I'm so strong! You should do it too.
			Thunderstorm2: If you're gonna let yourself get soaked, remember to take a bath afterwards. Wouldn't want ya to get sick.
			Guide: Sigh, I'm going to miss {0}. I know why you had to do it, but—wait he's back already?!
			SeaKing: There's a rumour going around that Amidias grows bigger when it rains. Something about the surface air drying him out normally. Who started this rumour? Why, me of course!
			EasyHandIn: easy hand in text
			ModerateHandIn: moderate hand in text
			HeroicHandIn: heroic hand in text
			HandInFailure: hand in failure. {0} {^0:enemy;enemies} left
			Gravedigger: gravedigger quest give
			BloodMoonFishing: blood moon fishing quest give
			Clickbait: nymph quest give
			ShadowWizard: tim quest give
			TheMightyKraken: dreadnautilus quest give
		}

		TownNPCMood: {
			Content: I am content.
			NoHome: I hate not having a home.
			FarFromHome: I may have gotten myself exiled.
			LoveSpace: Can never have too much space to experiment, right?
			DislikeCrowded: Terrarian... there are too many people here. The beast within hungers.
			HateCrowded: popcorn help i cant do mark dialogue.
			LikeNPC_Princess: I like {NPCName}.
			Princess_LovesNPC: I like {NPCName}.
		}
	}
